                 'There are16loading yields,16readiness waits,16sourcewake calls,16actualremovals,48handoffs,32returns and16payloads totaling1538816bytes. Two unique payloads are MHSP89068bytes andMASP103284bytes. No resourcebody/readyflag scripts. BIOS303C/3042 and controlled external file completion events remain.',
                 'Main21-context world/actor scene still does not execute synchronization; it is a separate16case regression with32payloads/3080416bytes. Input/world/task-loop DF8C propagation and original game task linkage remain incomplete. Render/queueconsumer/remainingtasks/scenes/audio/uninterruptedboot/fullgame remain unfinished.',
                 'Two bounded local replies are correct, around16.88/17.29SDKseconds. General model reliability, nativeChat display/provider adoption and overall ease remain unproved. Earlier rejected concise-prompt trials remain preserved; previous canonical prompt stays unchanged.',
